{title: Revelation Song (FJ_159_en)}
{song_number: 159}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Worthy is the [Gm7]Lamb who was slain;
[Bb]holy, holy [F]is He.
[C]Sing a new song to [Gm7]Him who sits on
[Bb]heaven's mercy [F]seat.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Holy, holy, holy is the [Gm7]Lord God Almighty,
[Bb]who was and is and is to [F]come.
With all [C]creation I sing praise to the [Gm7]King of Kings;
[Bb]You are my everything and [F]I will adore [C]You.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Clothed in rainbows of [Gm7]living color,
[Bb]flashes of lightning, [F]rolls of thunder.
[C]Blessing and honor, strength and [Gm7]glory and power be
[Bb]to You, the only [F]wise King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Holy, holy, holy is the [Gm7]Lord God Almighty,
[Bb]who was and is and is to [F]come.
With all [C]creation I sing praise to the [Gm7]King of Kings;
[Bb]You are my everything and [F]I will adore [C]You.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]Filled with wonder, [Gm7]awestruck wonder,
[Bb]at the mention of [F]Your name;
[C]Jesus, Your name is power, [Gm7]breath and living water,
[Bb]such a marvelous [F]mystery!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Holy, holy, holy is the [Gm7]Lord God Almighty,
[Bb]who was and is and is to [F]come.
With all [C]creation I sing praise to the [Gm7]King of Kings;
[Bb]You are my everything and [F]I will adore [C]You.
{end_of_chorus}
